{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_224_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_224","textTraditional":"一、十有一年，春，宋公之弟辰及仲佗、石彄、公子地自陳入於蕭以叛。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_224_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_224","textTraditional":"未失其弟也。以尊及卑也。自陳，陳有奉焉爾。入者，內弗受也。以者，不以也。叛，直叛也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_224_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_224","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_224_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_224","textTraditional":"三、秋，宋樂大心自曹入於蕭。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_224_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_224","textTraditional":"四、冬，及鄭平，叔還如鄭蒞盟。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}